1. default var name "item", word unit, default trimming collapses the templates own spacing: $foreach(items="alpha beta gamma", text="[$item] ")
2. custom var name, kws text preserves the templates own trailing space: $foreach<var=w>(items="x y z", kws text="($w) ")
3. line unit: $foreach<unit=line>(items="one
two
three", kws text="- $item
")
4. paragraph unit, nested macro call: $foreach<unit=paragraph,var=p>(items="first para
still first

second para", kws text="$wrap(value=$p)
")
